  "about": {
    "_source": "Compiled from public listings/FB (Lucky Lion Electric Bicycle, main branch Imus, Cavite). Founding year not published — confirm with owner.",
    "heading": "About Lucky Lion eBike",
    "body": "Lucky Lion eBike is a Cavite-based electric vehicle retailer offering a wide lineup of e-bikes, e-trikes, and e-cars for everyday Filipino riders. From its main branch on Emilio Aguinaldo Highway, Palico II, Imus City, Cavite, Lucky Lion has grown to multiple branches across Cavite and Laguna — including the Trece Martires branch in Brgy. San Agustin. Every unit is backed by lifetime service, flexible payment options (cash, Home Credit installment, and credit card), and free delivery within Cavite and selected areas — Quality Ride, Trusted Performance. In December 2022, Lucky Lion was honored as the Best E-Bike Marketing Company by The World Class Philippines Awards Council."
  },
